       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TBLPRT.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      *    THIS PROGRAM PRINTS THE DATA IN THE FILE "DBLOWUP.PUB".
      *    THE FILE "DBLOWUP.PUB" . THE FILE "DBLOWUP.PUB" IS
      *    WRITTEN TO BY THE SUBPROGRAM "TBLOWUP".  ANY PROGRAM
      *    THAT CALLS "TBLOWUP" TO HANDLE FATAL ERROR SITUATION
      *    WILL UPDATE THE FILE IF A FATAL ERROR IS
      *    ENCOUNTERED.  THIS PROGRAM SIMPLY DISPLAYS A FORMATTED
      *    OUTPUT OF THE FILE.
      *
      *    12/30/85.
      *        CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO GO TO "DBLOWUP.PUB"
      *         OR "DBLOWUPV.PUB", DEPENDING ON WHETHER THE USER
      *         WANTS TO SEE THE DB ERRORS OR THE VIEW ERRORS.
      *           CIH.
      *    06/08/00
      *        CHANGED TO MAKE DATE CHECKS ON WHAT GETS PRINTED
      *        TO BE Y2K COMPLIANT.
      *           JEC.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZRSCREEN-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT BLOWUP-FILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPBLOWUP
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(1500).

       FD  PRINT-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                     PIC X(132).

       FD  BLOWUP-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           RECORD CONTAINS 374 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS BLOWUP-RCD.
       01  BLOWUP-RCD.
           05  BF-PLT-CODE               PIC X(4).
           05  BF-BASE.
               10  FILLER                PIC X(2).
               10  BF-BASE-NAME          PIC X(6).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(8).
           05  BF-PGM-NAME.
               10  BF-PGM-NAME-1         PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(7).
           05  BF-STATUS-AREA            PIC X(20).
           05  BF-VIEW-COMAREA           PIC X(120).
           05  BF-KSAM-STATUS.
               10  K-STAT-1              PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  BF-MESSAGE                PIC X(60).
           05  BF-FLDS                   PIC X(110).
           05  BF-DATE.
               10  BF-DATE-MM            PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(1).
               10  BF-DATE-DD            PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(1).
               10  BF-DATE-YY            PIC X(2).
           05  BF-TIME                   PIC X(6).
           05  BF-USER                   PIC X(8).
           05  BF-ACCOUNT                PIC X(8).
           05  BF-TERM                   PIC 9(4).


      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  DBEXPLAIN-FLAG                PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
       77  DATE-FLAG                     PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
       77  PROGRAM-FLAG                  PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
       77  PROGRAM-NAME-TEST             PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  STARTING-DATE                 PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  PASSWORD                      PIC X(5)  VALUE "JADE;".
       77  BASE                          PIC X(9)  VALUE "  STORES;".
       77  MODE1                         PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 1.
       77  VIEW-ERROR-BUF                PIC X(75) VALUE SPACES.
       77  VIEW-ERROR-BUFFLEN            PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 75.
       77  VIEW-ERROR-ACTUALEN           PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
       77  RESULT                        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       77  SUB                           PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       77  FORMAT-WORD                   PIC ---------9.
       77  BLOWUP-FILE-SWITCH            PIC X(1).
       77  BLOWUPS-FOUND-COUNT           PIC 9(4).

       01  WORK-LINE                     PIC X(132) VALUE SPACES.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  ERROR-BUF                     PIC X(72) VALUE SPACES.
       01  ERROR-LEN                     PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.

       01  TEST-DATE-CN.
           05  TEST-DATE-CC              PIC X(2).
           05  TEST-DATE-YY              PIC X(2).
           05  TEST-DATE-MM              PIC X(2).
           05  TEST-DATE-DD              PIC X(2).

       01  TEST-SB-DATE-CN.
           05  TEST-SB-DATE-CC           PIC X(2).
           05  TEST-SB-DATE-YYMMDD.
               10  TEST-SB-DATE-YY       PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(4).

       01  ASTERICK-LINE                 PIC X(79) VALUE ALL "*".
       COPY COMMAND IN COPYLIB.
       01  COMMAND-LINE-WORK.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(16) VALUE
               "FILE DBLOWUP.DB=".
           05  COMMAND-FILE2             PIC X(65) VALUE SPACES.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
       01  STATUS-AREA2.
           05  COND-WORD2                PIC S9(4)   BINARY.
           05  DATA-LENG2                PIC S9(4)   BINARY.
           05  RCD-NO2                   PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
           05  CHAIN-LENG2               PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
           05  BKWD-ADDR2                PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
           05  FWRD-ADDR2                PIC S9(9)   BINARY.

       COPY TSHWRDFM   OF COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CSWITCHF   OF COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP    OF COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE   OF COPYLIB.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER                PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-BUFFER.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1      PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(67).
           05  MSG-VALUE                 PIC X(8).
       01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    BINARY.
       01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0     BINARY.
       01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     BINARY.

       01  FORMFILE.
           05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FRSCREEN".
           05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
           05  FORM-GNAME.
               10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
               10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.


       01  DE-FIELDS.
           05  SB-VIEW-OR-OTHERS         PIC X(26).
           05  SB-PLANT                  PIC X(4).
           05  SB-DB                     PIC X(14).
           05  SB-APPL                   PIC X(4).
           05  SB-DATE                   PIC X(6).
           05  SB-PROGRAM                PIC X(8).
           05  SB-SORT                   PIC X.
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE           PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE           PIC X(79).

       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.
       COPY FUNCTDEF IN COPYLIB.

       01  DISPLAY-FLDS.
           05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE OCCURS 5  TIMES.
               10  DISPLAY-FLD           PIC X(14).
               10  DISPLAY-FLD9          PIC S9(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-HOUSEKEEP.
           MOVE ZERO                     TO  BLOWUPS-FOUND-COUNT.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.

       6000-MAIN.

           MOVE "FBLPRT"                 TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 9951-GETNEXTFORM.
           MOVE "DOESNT MATTER"          TO  SB-VIEW-OR-OTHERS.
           MOVE "ALL"                    TO  SB-PLANT.
           MOVE "ALL"                    TO  SB-DB.
           MOVE "ALL"                    TO  SB-APPL.
           MOVE "000000"                 TO  SB-DATE.
           MOVE "ALL"                    TO  SB-PROGRAM.
           MOVE "6"                      TO  SB-SORT.

       6010-SHOWFORM.
           MOVE 7                        TO  SRF-KEYSET.
           PERFORM 9953-PUTBUFFER.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 9989-WS-X.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
               GO TO 6010-SHOWFORM.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8
              GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

      *---------- READ DATA BUFFER
           PERFORM 9952-GETBUFFER.

           MOVE SB-VIEW-OR-OTHERS        TO  COMMAND-FILE2.
           MOVE SB-DATE                  TO  TEST-SB-DATE-YYMMDD.
           MOVE "20"                     TO  TEST-SB-DATE-CC.
           IF TEST-SB-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"                 TO  TEST-SB-DATE-CC.

           PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-BLOWUP.

           PERFORM 9972-CLOSE-FORM-TERM.

           OPEN INPUT BLOWUP-FILE.


       6100-READ-LOOP.
           READ BLOWUP-FILE
               AT END GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

           IF BF-DATE-YY = "  "
               MOVE "00"                 TO  TEST-DATE-YY
           ELSE
           MOVE BF-DATE-YY               TO  TEST-DATE-YY.
           IF BF-DATE-MM = "  "
               MOVE "00"                 TO  TEST-DATE-MM
           ELSE
           MOVE BF-DATE-MM               TO  TEST-DATE-MM.
           IF BF-DATE-DD = "  "
               MOVE "00"                 TO  TEST-DATE-DD
           ELSE
           MOVE BF-DATE-DD               TO  TEST-DATE-DD.
           MOVE "20"                     TO  TEST-DATE-CC.
           IF TEST-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"                 TO  TEST-DATE-CC.

           IF TEST-DATE-CN < TEST-SB-DATE-CN
                   GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           IF SB-PROGRAM = "***"
               IF BF-PGM-NAME-1 < "A" OR > "X"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF SB-PROGRAM NOT = "ALL"
               IF BF-PGM-NAME = SB-PROGRAM
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           IF SB-PLANT NOT = "ALL"
              IF BF-PLT-CODE = SB-PLANT
                 NEXT SENTENCE
              ELSE
                 GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           IF SB-DB NOT = "ALL"
              IF BF-BASE-NAME = SB-DB
                 NEXT SENTENCE
              ELSE
                 GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           IF SB-APPL = "ALL"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              IF SB-APPL = "CSIS"
                 IF BF-BASE-NAME = "STORES" OR "STHIST" OR "CSACCT" OR
                   "              "
                    NEXT SENTENCE
                 ELSE
                    GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP
              ELSE
                 IF BF-BASE-NAME = "STORES" OR "STHIST" OR "CSACCT"
                    GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           ADD 1                         TO  BLOWUPS-FOUND-COUNT.

           MOVE BF-STATUS-AREA           TO  STATUS-AREA.
           MOVE BF-VIEW-COMAREA          TO  VIEW-COMAREA.
           MOVE BF-FLDS                  TO  DISPLAY-FLDS.

           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ASTERICK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING  "****   BLOWUP OF ", BF-PGM-NAME, " ** ",
           BF-DATE, " ** ", BF-TIME, " ** ", BF-USER, ".",
           BF-ACCOUNT, " ", BF-TERM, "  ****" DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ASTERICK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO  ERROR-BUF.
           PERFORM 9999-DBERROR.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM ERROR-BUF AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING  "MESSAGE= ", BF-MESSAGE,
                   "PLANT=", BF-PLT-CODE DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE COND-WORD                TO  FORMAT-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING  "COND-WORD =   ", FORMAT-WORD DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           MOVE VIEW-STATUS              TO  FORMAT-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING  "VIEW-STATUS = ", FORMAT-WORD DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           IF VIEW-STATUS NOT = 0
                PERFORM 9973-CALL-VERRMSG
                WRITE PRINT-REC FROM VIEW-ERROR-BUF AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING  "FILE-STATUS = ", BF-KSAM-STATUS DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           IF K-STAT-1 = "9"
               PERFORM 9999-CKERROR
               MOVE RESULT               TO  FORMAT-WORD
               MOVE SPACES               TO  WORK-LINE
               STRING  "KSAM FILE ERROR, RESULT = ", RESULT
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WORK-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           MOVE 0                        TO  SUB.
       6200-DISPLAY-FLD-LOOP.
           ADD 1                         TO  SUB.
           IF SUB > 5
               MOVE SPACES               TO  PRINT-REC
               WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1
               GO TO 6100-READ-LOOP.

           IF DISPLAY-FLD (SUB) = SPACES OR "00000000000000"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES               TO  WORK-LINE
               STRING  "FIELD ", SUB, " = ", DISPLAY-FLD (SUB)
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WORK-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           IF DISPLAY-FLD9 (SUB) NOT = 0
               MOVE SPACES               TO  WORK-LINE
               STRING  "NUMERIC FIELD ", SUB, " = ",
                 DISPLAY-FLD9 (SUB) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                 INTO WORK-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           GO TO 6200-DISPLAY-FLD-LOOP.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING BLOWUPS-FOUND-COUNT,
             " BLOWUPS QUALIFIED FOR REPORT" DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WORK-LINE
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM WORK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           GOBACK.

      *********************************************************************
      *   CSWITCH SWITCHES BETWEEN TWO FORMS AND HANDLES VIEW AND DL SIZE *
      *   ERRORS BY LOOPING 5 TIMES AND THEN PASSING AN ERROR MESSAGE.    *
      *********************************************************************
       800-CALL-CSWITCHF.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           CALL "CSWITCHF" USING VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                           FORMFILE, CSF-PARMS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE FORM-GNAME           TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD(2)
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

       990-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TBLPRT"                 TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE VIEW-NFNAME              TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
       999-EXIT.  EXIT.
       COPY HCATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPCAL2 IN COPYLIB.

       9951-GETNEXTFORM.
       9952-GETBUFFER.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DE-FIELDS.

       9953-PUTBUFFER.
           MOVE DE-FIELDS TO DISPLAY-REC.

       9954-SETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.

       9955-CLEAR-FORM.
           MOVE SPACES TO DE-FIELDS, MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       9956-PUTWINDOW.
       9957-FIELDEDITS.
       9958-INITFORM.
       9959-SHOWFORM.
       9960-SETKEYLABEL.
       9961-AUTOREAD.
       9962-OPENFORM.
       9963-CLOSEFORM.
       9964-FINISHFORM.
       9972-CLOSE-FORM-TERM.
      *------ FOR IBM WE GO TO PRINT FILE INSTEAD OF DISPLAYING,
      *------ SO WE DON'T CLOSE FORMFILE/TERM FILE

       9973-CALL-VERRMSG.
      *------ IBM HAS NO SUCH THING
           MOVE SPACES TO VIEW-ERROR-BUF.

       9999-DBERROR.
      *------ NOTE: IBM HAS NO COMPARIBLE SUBPROGRAM

       9999-OVERRIDE-BLOWUP.
      *------ NOTE: IBM HAS NO VIEW BLOWUP FILE, SO WE DO NOTHING HERE

       9999-CKERROR.
      *------ FOR IBM, NO FILE SYSTEM ERRORS IN THE FILE STATUS
           MOVE ZERO TO RESULT.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
